title: 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_영문
---
<<if get("lvPyo") >= 50>>
    (I'm heading toward the lecture hall.)
    <<play 공통_발소리>>
    (I was walking while listening to music with my earphones in, when I suddenly felt someone behind me.)
    (The chilling presence lingering behind me made me take out my earphones and look back.)
    (There's no one there.)
    <<like 서은표>>
    <<change lvPyo +5>>
    (Should I look around?)
    <<choice 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍1_영문 "Look around the area." 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_부1_영문 "Just go to the lecture hall.">>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_호감도_50미만_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍1_영문
---
(Something is definitely strange.)
<<play 공통_발소리>>
(There's still time before the lecture starts, and I can't shake this lingering unease, so I decided to look around.)
(I scanned the path I just walked...)
(And even checked the lecture halls where the lights were off.)
(No matter how much I look, it's suspiciously empty.)
(Was it just my imagination...?)
(It feels like the presence has disappeared.)
(!)
(Just then, a soccer ball-shaped badge lying on the hallway floor caught my eye.)
(It has a familiar logo on the ball.)
(Is this... the soccer club badge?)
(I picked up the badge for now.)
(Unable to find anything else, I headed to the lecture hall.)
(When I entered the room, EunPyo was there.)
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Hey, {name()}.
{name()}: Hey.
EunPyo: You're a bit late?
{name()}: Yeah. I was looking for something...
{name()}: Oh, by any chance, isn't this your club badge?
(I showed her the badge I just picked up.)
<<bgm_stop>>
<<show pyo_horror>>
<<wait 2>>
<<bgm_resume>>
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Ah...
<<show pyo_neg2>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: You're right.
{name()}: It's not yours, right? Check yours. I picked this up in the hallway earlier.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Uh... mine should be at home. Probably.
{name()}: Maybe it belongs to one of your soccer club friends? If anyone says they lost it, let them know.
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Okay. I'll find the owner and give it to them.
(EunPyo puts the badge into her bag pocket.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_부1_영문
---
(It felt uncomfortable, but I decided to just keep going.)
(When I entered the lecture hall, I saw the back of EunPyo's head.)
<<show pyo_blush>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Hey, {name()}.
{name()}: Hey.
EunPyo: You're a bit late?
{name()}: Am I? The traffic was a bit heavy today.
EunPyo: Hurry up and sit down.
<<choice 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍2_영문 "Sit in the seat next to her." 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_부2_영문 "I want to sit separately today.">>
(EunPyo moved her bag from the seat next to her to clear a spot.)
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
(I sat down next to EunPyo.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: You smell really nice again today.
{name()}: Really? Maybe it's the detergent...
(We chatted until the lecture started.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_부2_영문
---

<<dislike 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo -5>>
{name()}: I want to sit separately today.
<<show pyo_horror>>
EunPyo: Why?
<<wait 2>>
<<show pyo_neg2>>
EunPyo: There are no other seats. Just sit here.
<<jump 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_긍2_영문>>
===

title: 주5_금_2교시_강의실_서은표_호감도_50미만_영문
---
(On my way to the lecture hall, I see something glittering on the floor.)
(A soccer ball-shaped badge lying on the hallway floor caught my eye.)
(It has a familiar logo on the ball.)
(Is this... the soccer club badge?)
(I picked up the badge for now.)
(I thought of EunPyo, who is in the soccer club.)
(EunPyo will probably be in the lecture hall.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Hey, {name()}.
{name()}: Hey.
{name()}: I picked up this badge on my way here. Is it yours by any chance?
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Oh, it's a soccer club badge!
(EunPyo leans down to check her bag.)
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: Oh! It must be mine.
EunPyo: I originally had it pinned here on the front, but it's gone.
{name()}: Really? What are the odds that I'd be the one to find it.
{name()}: I'm glad I found the owner.
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: I know, I didn't even realize it was missing.
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
EunPyo: Thanks for finding it. Want to sit next to me?
{name()}: Sure.
(We attended the lecture together.)
<<end>>
===